==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|одна́ко}}
* {{hyphenation|ru|од|на́|ко}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-однако.ogg}}

===Adverb===
{{ru-adv|одна́ко}}

# [[however]], [[yet]], [[still]]
#: {{ux|ru|'''Одна́ко''' он та́кже установи́л значи́тельное число́ слу́чаев избие́ния лиц поли́цией.|He also found, '''however''', a considerable number of cases where persons were subjected to beatings by the police.}}
# {{lb|ru|regional|Siberia}} [[probably]]

====Usage notes====
Used in caricature (or racist) jokes with [[Chukchi]] people talking Russian, as a stereotype [[filler word]].

====Descendants====
* {{desc|izh|odnako|bor=1}}
* {{desc|krl|onnakko|bor=1}}

===Interjection===
{{head|ru|interjection|head=одна́ко}}

# [[you don't say]]!, [[no really]]!
